# Back from the Library to a floating sidebar (12 Nov 2026, the owner's call): with the pointer off
# the sidebar, the Library's slide back to the space leaves the floating sidebar out instead of taking
# it away as the slide lands; it goes once the pointer moves on away, comes onto it (then leaves as
# usual) or clicks outside it (FloatingSidebarReturnHold; the release is checked in
# scripts/test-floating-sidebar.sh, as a scenario can't move the pointer).
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
wait 2
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://action/showArchive
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=open
expect-log window state open: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1 drawer=400 library=archive
cra://debug?pointerOnSidebar=0
cra://debug?leaveLibrary=1
wait 1.5
expect-log floating sidebar stays after the Library
cra://debug?windowState=held
expect-log window state held: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1 drawer=0 library=-
cra://debug?pointerOnSidebar=auto
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=0
